{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0FuaW1hdGlvbi8yMDExLS0yMDIwL1N0b2xlbiUyMFByaW5jZXNzJTIwUnVzbGFuJTIwYW5kJTIwTHVkbWlsYSUyMCUyODIwMTglMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Stolen Princess Ruslan and Ludmila","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/jJaRhOk9FaPTIqP8L4NqnOYEXHo.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tZkRuGSa4we7D1SdGBN8qqtT4SI.jpg","description":"This wonderful story happened in the age of valiant knights, beautiful princesses, and battling sorcerers. Ruslan, a wandering artist dreaming to become a knight, met beautiful Mila and fell in love with her; he didn’t even suspect that she is the King’s daughter. However, the lovers’ happiness wasn’t meant to last too long. Chernomor, the evil sorcerer, appeared in a magic vortex and stole Mila right before Ruslan’s eyes to transform her power of love into his own magic power. Without further ado, Ruslan sets out on a chase after the stolen princess to overcome all obstacles and to prove that real love is stronger than magic.\n\nRated NR · Released 7 Mar 2018 · Ukraine · 85 min\nStudio: Animagrad Animation Studio, Ukrainian State Film Agency, Ukrainian Film School\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2018","genres":["Animation","Comedy","Adventure","Family","Animation"],"imdbRating":"6.7","imdb_id":"tt5378092","moviedb_id":463116,"tmdbId":463116,"runtime":"85 min","cast":["Nadya Dorofeeva","Oleksii Zavgorodnii","Yevhen Malukha","Oleh Mykhailiuta","Nikolay Boklan","Serhii Prytula","Yurii Horbunov","Roman Lutskyi"],"director":["Oleh Malamuzh"],"writer":["Yaroslav Voytseshek"],"released":"2018-03-07T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Love is stronger than magic","country":"Ukraine","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Oleh Malamuzh","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/uBlhOVRkIwgGSt10rZnzVyDAS9U.jpg"},{"name":"Nadya Dorofeeva","character":"Princess Mila (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/dfBwPU8RuCP9sF2AMOzIHXsVrMC.jpg"},{"name":"Oleks